(385, 'rajesshoree', 'Rajesshoree', 'রাজেশ্বরী', '<p>Endi-Silk</p>\r\n<p>A classic Endi silk sharee with hand block prints and fine hand stitches, set on a textured, graceful body.</p>\r\n<p><br>Comes in its own box &mdash; understated, timeless, and thoughtfully crafted.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>', 'gallery/Jg4DZSGGLQAqcPHrKu5slKjnVIfKpWk6ZrP9MZLp.jpg', 16, 20, 10, 10780.00, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'Standrnd', 'Taxable', '0', 'N', 'Add to Cart', '0', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'Y', 'Y', 'N', 'N', 'N', 'undefined', 'undefined', 'undefined', NULL, '1122422837503', NULL, NULL),
(386, 'torunbina', 'Torunbina', 'তরুণবীণা', '<p><span style=\"color: #ba372a;\">Half-Silk</span></p>\r\n<p>Half-silk saree graced with golden block-printed leaf motifs, beautifully accented with fine thread work along the border and achol.</p>', 'gallery/wXh7qTxQWBhsacC2SDcdybynVXKek27FiXl5qNd7.jpg', 16, 20, 11, 2200.00, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'Cloths', 'Taxable', '0', 'N', 'Add to Cart', '0', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'Y', 'Y', 'N', 'N', 'N', 'undefined', 'undefined', 'undefined', NULL, '1122596549030', NULL, NULL),
(387, 'himboti', 'Himboti', 'হিমবতী', '<p><span style=\"color: #ba372a;\">Half-Silk</span></p>\r\n<p>A graceful half-silk wax print saree, beautifully detailed with artistic block prints and highlighted with elegant bands for a timeless look.</p>', 'gallery/uu5z9emcIzSecNp6mpU6htdojlwuxRTuVBMmziNj.jpg', 16, 20, 11, 3080.00, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'Cloths', 'Taxable', '0', 'N', 'Add to Cart', '0', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'Y', 'Y', 'N', 'N', 'N', 'undefined', 'undefined', 'undefined', NULL, '1122518027986', NULL, NULL),
